{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44672","headline":"奉和窦使君同恭法师咏高僧二首 释僧肇 · 慧宣","name":"奉和窦使君同恭法师咏高僧二首 释僧肇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"般若唯绝凿，湼盘固无名。\n先贤未始觉，之子唱希声。\n秦王嗟理诣，童寿揖词清。\n徽音闻庐岳，精难动中京。\n适验方袍里，奇才复挺生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慧宣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44672.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44672","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}